<title>JORDAN: Jordan average dinar o/nite rates rise to 6.70 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan average dinar o/nite rates rise to 6.70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 6.70 percent on Tuesday from 5.09 percent on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded in three reported transactions worth 2.7 million dinars ($3.7 million) in deals concluded in a narrow 6.0 percent-7.0 percent range.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
